{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 2089579415579405659,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What Happens When You connect()",
      "source_hash": 2914315807917149649,
      "context_hash": 7611972270517194666,
      "translation": "connect()를 호출하면 일어나는 일",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The TCP three-way handshake from a kernel perspective",
      "source_hash": 10844833920125824896,
      "context_hash": 6081937755479321974,
      "translation": "커널 관점에서 본 TCP 3-way handshake",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Overview",
      "source_hash": 11777448466030057203,
      "context_hash": 746540492572610887,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When a client calls `connect()`, the kernel initiates a TCP three-way handshake.",
      "source_hash": 17870686965675668737,
      "context_hash": 15323393723625881828,
      "translation": "클라이언트가 `connect()`를 호출하면 커널은 TCP 3-way handshake를 시작합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The call may block until the connection is established (or timeout/error).",
      "source_hash": 8699799537454470154,
      "context_hash": 8999684366436171891,
      "translation": "이 호출은 연결이 수립될 때까지(또는 타임아웃이나 오류가 발생할 때까지) 블록될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The full sequence:",
      "source_hash": 13927293104013845969,
      "context_hash": 9731632376502361761,
      "translation": "전체 순서",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897049Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 1: connect() syscall → tcp_v4_connect()",
      "source_hash": 5166385032607668521,
      "context_hash": 2940188331874860046,
      "translation": "1단계: connect() 시스템 콜 → tcp_v4_connect()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The syscall path:",
      "source_hash": 16500577715188050255,
      "context_hash": 8638305677869182073,
      "translation": "시스템 콜 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 2: tcp_v4_connect()",
      "source_hash": 2736004386451784239,
      "context_hash": 6805976578511581541,
      "translation": "2단계: tcp_v4_connect()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 3: tcp_connect() — sending the SYN",
      "source_hash": 5011129610399715034,
      "context_hash": 7018260059986989210,
      "translation": "3단계: tcp_connect() — SYN 전송",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "SYN options set in the SYN packet:",
      "source_hash": 16533014697474925070,
      "context_hash": 8655309333878854054,
      "translation": "SYN 패킷에 설정되는 SYN 옵션",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**MSS** (Maximum Segment Size): tells the server the max segment we'll accept",
      "source_hash": 5587341007627331591,
      "context_hash": 5885590574105559659,
      "translation": "**MSS**(Maximum Segment Size): 우리가 받을 수 있는 최대 세그먼트 크기를 서버에 알림",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**WSCALE**: window scaling factor for large windows",
      "source_hash": 11579769287954704752,
      "context_hash": 1897438852733848926,
      "translation": "**WSCALE**: 큰 윈도를 위한 윈도 스케일링 계수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897050Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**SACK_PERM**: we support Selective ACK",
      "source_hash": 14422938817352939336,
      "context_hash": 13283337418489794482,
      "translation": "**SACK_PERM**: Selective ACK 지원 여부",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Timestamp**: for RTT measurement and PAWS (Protection Against Wrapped Sequences)",
      "source_hash": 10694687977270163064,
      "context_hash": 17719128071559315385,
      "translation": "**타임스탬프**: RTT 측정 및 PAWS(Protection Against Wrapped Sequences)용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "timestamp": "타임스탬프"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:25.171826Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 4: Server processes SYN → tcp_rcv_state_process()",
      "source_hash": 16919216363473620557,
      "context_hash": 900567884107383947,
      "translation": "4단계: 서버의 SYN 처리 → tcp_rcv_state_process()",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "On the server side:",
      "source_hash": 17432576002606544708,
      "context_hash": 13122149950806756196,
      "translation": "서버 측",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The server creates a **request socket** (`struct request_sock`) — a lightweight half-open connection entry.",
      "source_hash": 2397129777043399768,
      "context_hash": 2916572514565237173,
      "translation": "서버는 가벼운 half-open 연결 항목인 **request socket**(`struct request_sock`)을 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The full `struct sock` is only allocated when the third ACK arrives.",
      "source_hash": 5299165765298524312,
      "context_hash": 14312611343262241838,
      "translation": "완전한 `struct sock`은 세 번째 ACK가 도착했을 때에야 할당됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 5: Client processes SYN-ACK → ESTABLISHED",
      "source_hash": 15141481586504825542,
      "context_hash": 6258927342406362140,
      "translation": "5단계: 클라이언트의 SYN-ACK 처리 → ESTABLISHED",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`connect()` unblocks and returns 0.",
      "source_hash": 2123814417676719366,
      "context_hash": 13159472340615077645,
      "translation": "`connect()`의 블록이 해제되고 0을 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Phase 6: Server processes ACK → accept() returns",
      "source_hash": 7632791409401564216,
      "context_hash": 6197610776315433837,
      "translation": "6단계: 서버의 ACK 처리 → accept() 반환",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SYN backlog and accept queue",
      "source_hash": 293537075581818950,
      "context_hash": 7398585894673546966,
      "translation": "SYN backlog와 accept 큐",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The server maintains two queues:",
      "source_hash": 16600659852230031744,
      "context_hash": 1077791672827442585,
      "translation": "서버는 두 개의 큐를 유지합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queues": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Controlled by:",
      "source_hash": 10452875021549871249,
      "context_hash": 11566874197951232783,
      "translation": "제어 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A full accept queue → new ACKs are dropped → client retries (appears as connection slowness, not error).",
      "source_hash": 8712076168623323695,
      "context_hash": 18021573138847505096,
      "translation": "accept 큐가 가득 차면 → 새 ACK가 드롭되고 → 클라이언트가 재시도합니다(오류가 아니라 연결 지연으로 나타납니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "A full SYN queue → SYN cookies or SYN drop.",
      "source_hash": 17218436623509839443,
      "context_hash": 18392846654039143731,
      "translation": "SYN 큐가 가득 차면 → SYN cookie를 사용하거나 SYN을 드롭합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SYN cookies",
      "source_hash": 3448604276369793129,
      "context_hash": 16234099756176121650,
      "translation": "SYN cookie",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Under SYN flood attack, the SYN queue fills.",
      "source_hash": 7678086654166651704,
      "context_hash": 8270145178579294071,
      "translation": "SYN flood 공격을 받으면 SYN 큐가 가득 찹니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "SYN cookies encode connection state in the ISN, avoiding SYN queue entries:",
      "source_hash": 9642582903182528238,
      "context_hash": 4624696571075748570,
      "translation": "SYN cookie는 연결 상태를 ISN에 인코딩하여 SYN 큐 항목을 만들지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:54:32.897051Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "With SYN cookies, the server doesn't create a request_sock on SYN receipt.",
      "source_hash": 13612415723469468125,
      "context_hash": 2548172654815450612,
      "translation": "SYN cookie를 사용하면 서버는 SYN을 수신할 때 request_sock을 생성하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:31.560150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Instead, it encodes the connection parameters in the SYN-ACK's sequence number.",
      "source_hash": 5157600986913579360,
      "context_hash": 12990525539302139137,
      "translation": "대신 연결 매개변수를 SYN-ACK의 시퀀스 번호에 인코딩합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:31.560152Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "When the ACK arrives with the valid cookie, the connection is established without ever having been in the SYN queue.",
      "source_hash": 3024885572016612965,
      "context_hash": 6120277461268803998,
      "translation": "유효한 cookie를 담은 ACK가 도착하면, 연결은 SYN 큐에 한 번도 들어가지 않은 채로 수립됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "queue": "큐"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:31.560153Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Ephemeral port selection",
      "source_hash": 7851222358731578647,
      "context_hash": 2578000990800998402,
      "translation": "임시 포트(ephemeral port) 선택",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:31.560154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Observing the connection",
      "source_hash": 1615659439284876164,
      "context_hash": 8676540318169913076,
      "translation": "연결 관찰하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:06:31.560155Z",
      "issues": []
    },
